## 1. Scope and definitions

"Licensed Materials" means the AutoYou source code, AutoYou Server, AutoYou
Lite, client applications, built-in agents, bundled first-party `.ayskin`
assistant skins and `.aygame` HTML5 packages, documentation, scripts, assets,
and object-code builds distributed by OpenStorey under this License, including
modifications to those materials. Separately licensed third-party components
and independent works are excluded to the extent described in section 5.

For original AutoYou materials included in this distribution, OpenStorey also
offers this Version 1.5 as an alternative to earlier AutoYou license versions
identified in file metadata. This does not relicense third-party materials or
change the terms of copies previously distributed under another version.

"Individual Use" (also referred to in AutoYou documentation and packaging as
"Personal Use") means use by a natural person, under that person's own control,
for their own personal, household, educational, accessibility, research, or
individual productivity activities on equipment they own or are authorized to
use. An activity does not cease to be Individual Use solely because it is
performed in a professional setting or produces personal income. It includes
incidental assistance to another person, without charge or for total
compensation no greater than the applicable local statutory minimum hourly wage
for the time spent providing that assistance. This limit defines a license
permission; it does not determine employment status or alter wage law. Where no
such minimum applies, the exception covers assistance without charge.
Individual Use excludes Institutional Use and Commercial Exploitation.

"Institutional Use" (also referred to as "Enterprise Use") means deployment,
provision, or administration of the Licensed Materials by or on behalf of a
legal entity, employer, company, partnership, public body, educational or
nonprofit institution as an organization, or other organized operation for use
by its personnel, customers, members, or other beneficiaries, or as part of its
organized delivery of products or services. A natural person's independently
controlled use does not become Institutional Use merely because an organization
benefits from that person's work.

"Commercial Exploitation" means selling, renting, leasing, sublicensing for a
fee, commercially distributing, white-labeling, or supplying paid access to the
Licensed Materials or a product or service incorporating them; operating them
as a hosted, managed, or customer-support service for others; or charging for
their deployment or bundled support. Incidental assistance expressly permitted
above is excluded. Income from independent works is governed by section 5.

"Official Build" means a release artifact expressly designated, signed, and
distributed by OpenStorey or its authorized release operator as an official
AutoYou release. A source build, fork, or modified package does not become an
Official Build by using the same version number or retaining copyright notices.

"AutoYou Owner Board" refers to an internal governance designation used by
OpenStorey. It is not a separate legal entity, contracting party, licensor,
guarantor, fiduciary, or joint operator. OpenStorey LLC is the sole licensor
for this License.

