## 6. User Responsibility and Lawful Operation

AutoYou is user-directed, self-operated software. You are solely responsible
for your deployment, modifications, access controls, device/biometric locks,
credentials, backups, dependencies, prompts, local or cloud AI models (and any
automatic fallback models), automated browser or desktop actions, connected
messaging or cloud services, user-imported `.ayskin` skin packs, HTML5 games,
media streams, optional third-party social/media embeds, and authorized
actions.

You must obtain all required rights, notices, consents, and permissions, and
comply with applicable law and third-party platform or provider terms in every
jurisdiction where you operate or reach recipients. Do not use the Licensed
Materials for unauthorized system access, unlawful surveillance, non-consensual
recording or wiretapping, malware, spam, bulk unsolicited messaging,
circumvention of technological protection measures, intellectual-property or
likeness infringement (including importing third-party character art or audio
in `.ayskin` packages without permission), deceptive AI impersonation
(including removing mandatory `(AI)` disclosures on automated replies),
harassment, or other unlawful conduct.

When you use Page Agent media playback, direct-first CDN media fetches, or
optional inline third-party embeds (such as Instagram or other external media
frames), your browser or device communicates directly with those third-party
hosts under their terms and privacy policies unless routed through your own
server relay. You are responsible for ensuring your access and playback comply
with the applicable content provider's terms.

Review generated outputs, transcriptions, translations, calculations, and
automated actions before relying on them. The Licensed Materials are not an
emergency service, medical device, legal or financial advisory service, or a
substitute for qualified human judgment. Local biometric or device-credential
locks (such as Apple `LocalAuthentication` Face ID / Touch ID or Android
`BiometricPrompt`), loopback OTP autofill, and encryption controls reduce risk
but do not guarantee freedom from data loss, unauthorized access, or dependency
compromise.

This License grants no right to hosted AutoYou accounts, Cloud Pair, relays,
STUN/TURN/ICE servers, push notification gateways, reverse proxies, provider
APIs, app-store distributions, support, or future updates. Separately supplied
applications and hosted services have their own terms and privacy notices;
those terms do not alter this License for a standalone source installation.

