Your permissions under this License terminate automatically upon material
breach. Upon termination, you must cease the unauthorized use and distribution.
If a non-patent breach can be cured and you cure it within 30 days of
discovering it or receiving notice (whichever is earlier), your permissions are
reinstated unless OpenStorey previously reinstated them for the same type of
breach. Reinstatement does not waive remedies for past conduct. Compliant
recipients retain their independent permissions. Sections 1, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, and
9 survive termination.

